        {
          "anchor": "'NST-EST2023-POP'!A63",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Vintage 2023 data products are associated with Data Management System projects P-6000042, P-7501659, and P-7527355. The U.S. Census Bureau reviewed these data products for unauthorized disclosure of confidential information and approved the disclosure avoidance practices applied to this release (CBDRB-FY24-0085).  ",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "role": "note",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor": "'NST-EST2023-POP'!A64",
          "inlines": [
            {
              "text": "Note: The estimates are developed from a base that integrates the 2020 Census, Vintage 2020 estimates, and (for the U.S. only) 2020 Demographic Analysis estimates.  For population estimates methodology statements, see https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/popest/technical-documentation/methodology.html. See Geographic Terms and Definitions at https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/popest/guidance-geographies/terms-and-definitions.html for a list of the states that are included in each region. All geographic boundaries for the 2023 population estimates series are as of January 1, 2023.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "role": "note",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
